---
title: Charlie Hill
---
**Client / Site:** Charlie Hill. Writer.

**Scope:** Legacy Modernization & Migration plus Accessibility Audit

**Initial State:** 11 automated and manual failures. High-severity keyboard trap inside the mobile hamburger menu. Modals allowed keyboard focus to escape into the background page, confusing screen reader browse modes.

**Key Remediation:** Authored a robust JavaScript focus-trap script conforming to WAI-ARIA APG patterns, locking focus inside active mobile menus/modals and mapping the Esc key to exit cleanly.\
[View Code Before/After on GitHub](https://github.com/nickcosm/charliehillwriter)\
\
**Initial site build with Publii CMS**
- [Previous site audit](/Assessment_20260930_CharlieHillWriter.html)

**Site rebuild using Astro + TinaCMS**
